**# Objective**
The objective of this milestone was to implement the planned enterprise network in Cisco Packet Tracer and verify its functionality.
The implementation included VLAN segmentation, inter-VLAN routing, DHCP, DNS, application services, ACL-based security, WAN connectivity, NAT/PAT, and end-to-end network verification.
The completed network will serve as the traffic-generation environment for the subsequent Wireshark and TShark packet analysis phase.

**# Enterprise Network Architecture**
The enterprise network was implemented for **\*\*TechNova Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\*\*** using a multilayer switching architecture.
The network consists of:
\* Core Layer 3 switch (**\*\*Core-SW1\*\***)
\* Departmental access switches
\* HR PCs
\* Sales PCs
\* IT PCs
\* Infrastructure Server
\* Application Server
\* Edge Router (**\*\*R1\*\***)
\* Simulated ISP network
The Core-SW1 provides inter-VLAN routing, while R1 provides connectivity between the internal enterprise network and the simulated external network.

