**# Issues Encountered and Resolutions**
### Issue 1 – DHCP Failure
**Problem:** HR and Sales PCs initially failed to obtain IP addresses.
**Cause:** ACL rules were blocking DHCP traffic.
**Solution:** Added an explicit DHCP permit rule:
```text
permit udp any eq 68 any eq 67
```
**Result:** DHCP successfully assigned addresses to all departmental PCs.

### Issue 2 – WAN Connectivity Failure
**Problem:** Internal clients could access internal services but initially could not reach the simulated WAN.
**Cause:** R1 did not have the required routes to the internal VLAN networks.
**Solution:** Added static routes on R1 through Core-SW1.
**Result:** End-to-end WAN connectivity was successfully established.

